      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've got this really nasty cough that wont go away and it's super productive, like i can barely sleep. i was looking at some Robitussin or something with dextromethorphan in it to help stop the coughing at night. i'm currently on Zoloft for my depression, is it okay to take the dextro with my Zoloft or is there something else i should get?",
