      "content": "i get that, but i'm really struggling to sleep and i don't want to wait days for an appointment just for a cough. i read online that dextromethorphan is pretty standard and most people take it without issues. is the interaction actually a big deal or is it just a standard precaution? i just need to know if it's safe enough to try tonight so i can get some rest.",
